<section>
  <div class="wrap narrow prose">
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Trung tâm Anh ngữ Palm River Academy, {{ site.campus.address }}, Việt Nam. We decide what is kept and how it is used. Questions go to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or {{ site.phone }}.</p>

    <h2>What we keep</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>From enrollment:</strong> your child's name, date of birth and class; the parents' names and contact details; the people allowed to pick your child up; and any health information you give us, such as allergies or medicine.</li>
      <li><strong>While your child studies with us:</strong> attendance, progress reports, invoices and payments.</li>
      <li><strong>Photos and videos</strong> taken in class, on trips and at events.</li>
      <li><strong>Messages</strong> you send us by email, Zalo, WhatsApp, Facebook or the contact form on this website.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we use it for</h2>
    <p>To teach and look after your child, keep them safe (who may collect them, what to do if they are unwell), write progress reports, send invoices and receipts, and keep in touch with you. We use photos to share your child's day with you and to show families what happens at PRA. We do not sell your information or pass it to advertisers.</p>

    <h2>Photos of children</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>If you do not want your child's photo shared, tell the office. We keep a no-photo list, and every photo is checked against it before it goes on Facebook or this website.</li>
      <li>Photos waiting to be checked are kept in private storage that only office staff can open.</li>
      <li>Before a photo is posted, we remove the details a camera hides in the file, such as where it was taken and whose phone took it.</li>
      <li>If you want a photo taken down, tell us and we will remove it from this website and our Facebook Page.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who can see it</h2>
    <p>Only PRA staff who need it for their work. Teachers see what they need for their classes; invoices and payments stay with the office. We keep our records in our own office system, which only staff accounts can sign in to, and we use Google for email and documents. Messages you send through Zalo, WhatsApp or Facebook are also held by those services.</p>
    <p>We share information outside PRA only when you ask us to, or when the law requires it.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>While your child studies with us, and afterwards for as long as our accounts or the law require. Photos on this website and our Facebook Page stay up unless you ask us to take them down.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask to see what we hold about you or your child, to have it corrected or deleted, or to stop us using your child's photos. Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or ask at the office. We will not delete records the law requires us to keep, such as invoices, and we will tell you if that applies.</p>

    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>This website sets no cookies and uses no tracking or analytics. Its fonts come from Google Fonts, so your browser asks Google for them. If you use the contact form, what you type is sent to our office email.</p>

    <h2>Our Facebook app, The Current</h2>
    <p>Our staff post to the Palm River Academy Facebook Page from our office system, through a Meta app called The Current. The app posts only to our own Page. It is used only by PRA staff, and it does not collect or keep any information about people who see, like or comment on our posts.</p>

    <h2 id="delete">Deleting your information</h2>
    <p>The Current holds no information about Facebook users, so there is nothing in it to delete. To have anything else we hold about you deleted, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Delete%20my%20information">{{ site.email }}</a> with the subject "Delete my information". We will delete it and reply to confirm, apart from records the law requires us to keep.</p>

    <p class="prose__date">Last updated 30 September 2026.</p>
  </div>
</section>
